# Startup diagnostics registered with SpringApplication before an application context exists.
#
# Spring Boot loads FailureAnalyzer implementations through SpringFactoriesLoader's default resource
# location, which is this file: the AutoConfiguration.imports mechanism carries auto-configuration
# classes only. A FailureAnalyzer therefore cannot be a bean, and is declared here.
#
# See backend/docs/DECISION_LOG.md DL-305 for the reasoning; the analyzer's own contract is documented
# on the class.
org.springframework.boot.diagnostics.FailureAnalyzer=\
com.codeskeptic.scanner.config.DataSourceConfig$DatabaseStartupFailureAnalyzer
